Aao mere Agosh mein aa jao sakina<br>
Bano ne sada de ke na tadpao sakina<br>
<br>
Arma Tha Watan Jane Ka Utho Meri Beti<br>
Iss Tarha Koi Qakh Par Sota Nahi Bibi<br>
Ab Gham-Zada Maa Ke Gale Lag-jao Sakina<br>
<br>
Sujhe Huwe Ruksar Hai Gardan Bhi Hai Zaqmi<br>
Bhe-Ta Hai Musalsal Tere Kanou Se Laho Bhi<br>
Sabr Aaye Mujhe Kaise Ye Batlao Sakina<br>
<br>
Jo Sogaye Maqtal Me Wo Ab Ayenge Kaise<br>
Hum Tere Chacha Ko Yaha Bulwayenge Kaise<br>
Kyon Ruth Gayi Hum Se Ye Batlaou Sakina<br>
<br>
Waqhef Ho Mai Mudad Se Tujhe Neend Na Aaye<br>
Phir Bhi Koi Iss Tarha Tho Sota Nahi Bibi<br>
Jana Hai Watan Neend Se Uth Jao Sakina<br>
<br>
Raaz Aagaya Kaise Tumhe Zinda Ka Andhera<br>
Mai Kya Karo Kis Se Kahu Dam Ghut-Ta Hai Mera<br>
Iss Tarha Mujhe Aur Na Tadpao Sakina<br>
<br>
Kis Tarha Juda Hoga Badan Se Tere Kurta<br>
Souncha Bhi Na Tha Tera Kafan Ab Yahi Hoga<br>
Baba Se Shi-kayat Na Karo Jao Sakina<br>
<br>
Bano Yehi Kahti Thi Rasheed Ashk Bahakar<br>
Kaise Jiungi Beti Ko Turbat Me Sulakar<br>
Marjayegi Maa Sene Se Lagaou Sakina